    "description": "Set on the old town's Playa Los Muertos beach and overlooking the Pacific Ocean, this upscale resort is 2 km from the lively Malecón boardwalk.\nFeaturing terraces, the chic studios offer free Wi-Fi, flat-screens and safes. Some have whirlpool tubs and/or ocean views. The 1- and 2-bedroom suites add kitchenettes and living/dining areas.\nValet parking and breakfast are complimentary. There's a private beach featuring sunloungers, cabañas, and a hip bar and grill, plus a rooftop terrace with a sundeck and an infinity pool. Other amenities include a fitness center and hot tubs. Activities such as kayaking, volleyball and surfing are available."
